---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="migration-calendar">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Zanzibar & Tanzania Migration Calendar</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Plan your trip around the Great Migration and other wildlife movements — the best times to visit for wildlife viewing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Migration Overview</span>
        <h2>Understanding the Great Migration</h2>
        <p>Tanzania's Great Migration is one of nature's most spectacular events. While often associated with the Serengeti-Mara ecosystem, Zanzibar offers unique wildlife experiences year-round.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="migration-overview">
        <p>The Great Migration involves over 1.5 million wildebeest, zebra, and Thomson's gazelle moving in a circular pattern through the Serengeti-Mara ecosystem. The movement is driven by rainfall and grass growth, creating a dynamic calendar of wildlife viewing opportunities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Monthly Migration Calendar</span>
        <h2>When to See the Migration</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Track the movement of over 1.5 million wildebeest and zebras across the Serengeti ecosystem, perfectly timed with your Zanzibar beach holiday.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards-grid" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="card reveal" style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
          <div style="height: 180px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
            <img src="{{ 'great-migration-ndutu-calving-serengeti.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'great-migration-ndutu-calving-serengeti.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="position: absolute; top: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: #003853; color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px;">Jan – Mar</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 1.25rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #003853; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Southern Serengeti — Calving Season</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4e5d66; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Over 500,000 calves born on the lush Ndutu plains. Peak predator action with lions and cheetahs. Prime months for fly-in day safaris from Zanzibar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal delay-2" style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
          <div style="height: 180px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
            <img src="{{ 'serengeti-3-day-fly-in-safari-from-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'serengeti-3-day-fly-in-safari-from-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="position: absolute; top: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: #991b1b; color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px;">Jun – Jul</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 1.25rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #003853; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Grumeti &amp; Northern River Crossings</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4e5d66; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Dramatic river crossings as herds brave giant Nile crocodiles. Dry weather, optimal game viewing, and clear skies across the savannah.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal delay-3" style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
          <div style="height: 180px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
            <img src="{{ 'great-migration-mara-river-crossing.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'great-migration-mara-river-crossing.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="position: absolute; top: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: var(--dct-gold, #D4AF37); color: #0C1A24; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px;">Aug – Oct</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 1.25rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #003853; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Mara River &amp; Northern Frontier</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4e5d66; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Massive herds plunging into the Mara River before beginning the southward journey. Exceptional photography and seamless charter return to Zanzibar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal delay-4" style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
          <div style="height: 180px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
            <img src="{{ 'giraffe-zebras-savanna-afrika-1.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'giraffe-zebras-savanna-afrika-1.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="position: absolute; top: 0.75rem; left: 0.75rem; background: #059669; color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 50px;">Nov – Dec</span>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 1.25rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #003853; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Short Rains &amp; Southern Return</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4e5d66; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Fresh green pastures welcome returning herds to the southern plains. Lower tourist density, vibrant bird migrations, and emerald landscapes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Zanzibar Wildlife Highlights</span>
        <h2>Zanzibar's Own Wildlife Calendar</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="zanzibar-wildlife">
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal">
          <h3>Turtle Nesting</h3>
          <p>January - March: Green and hawksbill turtles nest on Zanzibar's beaches, particularly Nungwi and Jambiani.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Night turtle watching tours available</li>
            <li>Support conservation efforts</li>
            <li>See hatchlings make their way to the sea</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Dolphin Season</h3>
          <p>Year-round: Bottlenose and humpback dolphins are commonly sighted.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Best viewing: Early morning trips</li>
            <li>Kizimkazi (south coast) is the prime location</li>
            <li>Ethical dolphin watching guidelines apply</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Humpback Whales</h3>
          <p>July - October: Humpback whales migrate through Zanzibar channels.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Whale watching tours available</li>
            <li>Possible to see breaching and calf behavior</li>
            <li>Combine with safari and beach</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-4">
          <h3>Bird Migration</h3>
          <p>November - April: Migratory birds pass through Zanzibar.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Excellent for bird watching</li>
            <li>Many species from Europe and Asia</li>
            <li>Nungwi and Jambiani are prime spots</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Best Times to Visit</span>
        <h2>Combining Safari & Zanzibar</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="trip-recommendations">
        <div class="recommendation reveal">
          <h3>Safari First, Then Zanzibar</h3>
          <p>Many travelers do a mainland safari followed by a Zanzibar beach relaxation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>June - October: Best overall — dry season, great migration</li>
            <li>January - February: Great for calving season, less crowded</li>
            <li>Book safari lodges well in advance for peak season</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="recommendation reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Zanzibar First, Then Safari</h3>
          <p>Relax on the beach then explore Tanzania's wildlife.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>July - October: Whale watching combined with safari</li>
            <li>November - December: Lower rates, good value</li>
            <li>Perfect for honeymooners wanting beach then adventure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="recommendation reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Monthly Summary</h3>
          <p>January - March: Calving season, good birding, turtle nesting</p>
          <p>April - May: Low season, good deals, some lodges closed</p>
          <p>June - July: River crossings, peak season</p>
          <p>August - October: Masai Mara crossing, best wildlife viewing</p>
          <p>November - December: Return south, good value, birding</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Plan Your Timed Zanzibar Adventure</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your preferred travel month and we'll create a customized itinerary based on the migration calendar and your interests.</p>
